      "writtenOn": "2021-10-19T13:52:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had thought that, but wasn\u0027t sure. If I make it an sk_sp, do you think the command buffer takes ownership, or does it take a ref? My inclination is that it takes ownership, but I don\u0027t know if we intend on reusing these RenderPassDesc structs in any way.",
      "parentUuid": "83753c69_a7c06a38",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "4850a7764ec5ee309348e375aefd681bf3d30d14",
